  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="58bc964c-b04a-58b3-a536-2d6fc858c664" activityNameId="47d30d62-c20e-50fe-9feb-8616e2aca97f" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Rhodium, secondary, at refinery</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Rhodium, secondary, at refinery
This module describes the collecting of autocatalysts in Germany, the dismantling of the catalysts and the pyrometallurgical processing followed by a hydrometallurgical purification step. The multioutput-process "platinum group metal production, secondary, RER" delivers the co-products "platinum, secondary, at refinery", "palladium, secondary, at refinery" and "rhodium, secondary, at refinery". The smelter slag disposal is inventoried as disposal of inert material, thus neglecting potentially important (but unknown) heavy metal emissions.;
UUID: 6b21c896-c66f-37a1-9bb3-2aad6f676b7c
The module includes a collection step, with the transportation of the scrap to the intermediary dealer, a beneficiation step and a metallurgical step. Production, application and emissions of the most important agents are also included.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: After collection and transportation to the intermediary dealer, the scrap is ground in a mill. The resulting material is fed to specialised refineries. The metallurgical step consists of an arc-furnace. Same refining process as in primary production assumed (selective precipitation)
Time period: undefined
Production volume: 5.3 t / a
Sampling: Literature 
Extrapolations: see Geography and Technology
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_6b21c896-c66f-37a1-9bb3-2aad6f676b7c.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="20a9bf48-6cea-59b4-ad08-000cb981f2d0" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
